  "takeaways": [
    "A line is a specific price reference. A zone is a broader area of meaningful behavior.",
    "Price missing an exact line by a few points doesn’t mean the level failed.",
    "Keep zones tight enough to describe the reaction."
  ],
  "remember": "Give price room to behave. Don’t build a giant mystery box."
}
